<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<otobo_package version="1.0">
    <Name>ITSMPublicCMDB</Name>
<!-- nofilter(TidyAll::Plugin::OTOBO::SOPM::DocumentationPresent) -->
    <Version>0.0.0</Version>
    <Framework>11.0.x</Framework>
    <PackageRequired Version="11.0.1">ITSMCore</PackageRequired>
    <Vendor>Rother OSS GmbH</Vendor>
    <URL>https://otobo.de/</URL>
    <License>GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE Version 3, 29 June 2007</License>
    <Description Lang="en">The OTOBO::ITSM Public CMDB package.</Description>
    <Description Lang="de">Das OTOBO::ITSM Public CMDB Paket.</Description>
    <Description Lang="es">El paquete OTOBO::ITSM Public CMDB.</Description>
    <Description Lang="hu">Az OTOBO::ITSM Public CMDB csomag.</Description>
    <Filelist>
        <!-- TODO: move to Kernel? -->
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Modules/PublicITSMConfigItemAttachment.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Modules/PublicITSMConfigItem.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Modules/PublicITSMConfigItemSearch.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Modules/PublicITSMConfigItemZoom.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Config/Files/XML/PublicFramework.xml" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Config/Files/XML/PublicITSMConfigItem.xml" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/ITSMConfigItem/PublicOverviewSmall.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Layout/Public.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Templates/Standard/PublicFooter.tt" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Templates/Standard/PublicHeader.tt" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Templates/Standard/PublicITSMConfigItemOverviewSmall.tt" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Templates/Standard/PublicITSMConfigItemSearch.tt" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Templates/Standard/PublicITSMConfigItem.tt" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/Output/HTML/Templates/Standard/PublicITSMConfigItemZoom.tt" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Kernel/System/ITSMConfigItem/Permission/PublicPermission.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Custom/Kernel/Output/HTML/Base.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Custom/Kernel/Output/HTML/Layout.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Custom/Kernel/Output/HTML/ITSMConfigItem/DynamicField.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Custom/Kernel/Output/HTML/ITSMConfigItem/MenuGeneric.pm" />
        <File Permission="660" Location="Custom/Kernel/Output/HTML/Layout/ITSMConfigItem.pm" />
    </Filelist>
    <DatabaseInstall Type="post">
    </DatabaseInstall>
    <DatabaseUpgrade Type="post">
    </DatabaseUpgrade>
    <DatabaseUninstall Type="pre">
    </DatabaseUninstall>
    <CodeInstall Type="post"><![CDATA[

        # create the package name
        my $CodeModule = 'var::packagesetup::' . $Param{Structure}->{Name}->{Content};

        $Kernel::OM->Get($CodeModule)->CodeInstall();

    ]]></CodeInstall>
    <CodeReinstall Type="post"><![CDATA[

        # create the package name
        my $CodeModule = 'var::packagesetup::' . $Param{Structure}->{Name}->{Content};

        $Kernel::OM->Get($CodeModule)->CodeReinstall();

    ]]></CodeReinstall>
    <!-- It is IMPORTANT that all CodeUpgrade parts with version numbers come BEFORE the regular CodeUpgrade block without any version number! -->
    <CodeUpgrade Type="post" Version="10.0.3"><![CDATA[

        # create the package name
        my $CodeModule = 'var::packagesetup::' . $Param{Structure}->{Name}->{Content};

        # discard internally stored object, so that the next access to object creates them newly
        $Kernel::OM->ObjectsDiscard(
            Objects            => [$CodeModule],
            ForcePackageReload => 1,
        );

        $Kernel::OM->Get($CodeModule)->CodeUpgradeFromLowerThan_10_0_3();

    ]]></CodeUpgrade>
    <CodeUpgrade Type="post"><![CDATA[

        # create the package name
        my $CodeModule = 'var::packagesetup::' . $Param{Structure}->{Name}->{Content};

        # discard internally stored object, so that the next access to object creates them newly
        $Kernel::OM->ObjectsDiscard(
            Objects            => [$CodeModule],
            ForcePackageReload => 1,
        );

        $Kernel::OM->Get($CodeModule)->CodeUpgrade();

    ]]></CodeUpgrade>
    <CodeUninstall Type="pre"><![CDATA[

        # create the package name
        my $CodeModule = 'var::packagesetup::' . $Param{Structure}->{Name}->{Content};

        $Kernel::OM->Get($CodeModule)->CodeUninstall();

    ]]></CodeUninstall>
    <CodeUninstall Type="post"><![CDATA[

        {
            # cleanup stats list (only stats related to the given stat objects)
            $Kernel::OM->Get('Kernel::System::Stats')->StatsCleanUp(
                ObjectNames => [ 'ITSMConfigItem' ],
                UserID => 1,
            );
        }

    ]]></CodeUninstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="pre" Title="Install Information" Lang="en"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>WELCOME</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        You are about to install the OTOBO package ITSMConfigurationManagement.<br/>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        <strong>NOTE</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        The ITSMConfigurationManagement 11 has undergone major changes. This release, 11.0.1, is considered a beta.<br/>
        It is necessary to migrate your existing ConfigItem classes to the new structure. This can be done via the Console script bin/otobo.Console.pl Admin::ITSM::Configitem::UpgradeTo11.
        During its execution the definitions will be updated and dynamic fields for all custom (old xml) attributes will be created.<br/>
        Bundles of new default classes are available and can be imported in Admin->ConfigItems.<br/>
        <br/>
        <strong>REQUIRED OTOBO PACKAGES</strong>
        <ul>
        <li>ITSMCore 11.0.1</li>
        </ul>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))<br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="pre" Title="Installation Information" Lang="de"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>WILLKOMMEN</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Sie sind im Begriff das OTOBO-Paket ITSMConfigurationManagement zu installieren.<br/>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        <strong>HINWEIS</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Das Paket ITSMConfigurationManagement wurde mit der Version 11 stark überarbeitet. Dieses Release, 11.0.1, ist eine beta.<br/>
        Nach dem Upgrade von 10.1 müssen bestehende ConfigItem-Klassen zusätzlich auf die neue Struktur migriert werden. Hierzu steht das Console-Kommando bin/otobo.Console.pl Admin::ITSM::Configitem::UpgradeTo11 zu Verfügung.
        Dieses ändert die ConfigItem-Klassendefinitionen auf die neue Struktur und legt dynamische Felder für alle konfigurierbaren (d.h. die bisherigen xml-) Attribute an.<br/>
        Neue default-Klassen können unter Admin->ConfigItems direkt importiert werden.<br/>
        <br/>
        <strong>BENÖTIGTE OTOBO-PAKETE</strong>
        <ul>
        <li>ITSMCore 11.0.1</li>
        </ul>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))<br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="pre" Title="Install Information" Lang="es"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>BIENVENIDO</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Usted está punto de instalar el paquete ITSMConfigurationManagement de OTOBO.<br/>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        <strong>NOTA</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        El módulo ITSMConfigurationManagement 11 ha sufrido cambios mayores. Esta liberación, 11.0.1, es considerada una versión beta.<br/>
        Es necesario migrar sus definiciones existentes de clases de elementos de configuración (ConfigItems) a la nueva estructura.
        Esto puede ser realizado ejecutando el comando de consola: bin/otobo.Console.pl Admin::ITSM::Configitem::UpgradeTo11.
        Durante su ejecución, se actualizarán las definiciones de ConfigItems y se crearán nuevos campos dinámicos para todos los atributos personalizados existentes (antigua estructura XML).<br/>
        Una serie de nuevas clases por defecto están disponibles y pueden ser importadas mediante la opción: Admin->ConfigItems.<br/>
        <br/>
        <strong>PAQUETES OTOBO REQUERIDOS</strong>
        <ul>
        <li>ITSMCore 11.0.1</li>
        </ul>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))<br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="post" Title="Installation Information" Lang="en"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>NOTICE</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        In order to grant users access to the config item menu, you need to add them as member to the group 'itsm-configitem'.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        The menu items that were added by this package will be visible after you log-in to the system again.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))<br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="post" Title="Installation Information" Lang="de"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>HINWEIS</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Um Benutzern Zugriff auf das ConfigItem-Menü zu gewähren, müssen diese Mitglied der neuen Gruppe 'itsm-configitem' sein.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Die von diesem Paket hinzugefügten Menü-Punkte sind erst nach einem erneuten Anmeldevorgang im System sichtbar.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))<br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="post" Title="Installation Information" Lang="es"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>ATENCIÓN</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Para permitirles a los usuarios el acceso al menú de los elementos de configuración, es necesario que se den de
        alta como miembros del grupo 'itsm-configitem'.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Los elementos del menú que se agregaron por este paquete, serpan visibles después reiniciar la sesión al sistema.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))
        <br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="post" Title="Telepítési információk" Lang="hu"><![CDATA[

        <br/>
        <strong>FIGYELMEZTETÉS</strong>
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Annak érdekében, hogy hozzáférést adjon a felhasználók számára a konfigurációelem menühöz, hozzá kell adnia őket az „itsm-configitem” csoporthoz tagként.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        Azok a menüpontok, amelyeket ez a csomag adott hozzá, azután lesznek láthatóak, miután ismét bejelentkezik a rendszerbe.
        <br/>
        <br/>
        ((enjoy))<br/>
        <br/>

    ]]></IntroInstall>
